devil-damnation-soul-name = my soul
devil-damnation-pacifism-name = give up my will to fight
devil-damnation-blindness-name = give up my sight
devil-damnation-time-name = give up my life
devil-damnation-credits-name = give up my riches
devil-damnation-purpose-name = lose my purpose
devil-damnation-humanity-name = lose my humanity
devil-damnation-organ-name = give up an organ
devil-damnation-terminator-name = become a target
devil-damnation-mute-name = lose my voice
devil-damnation-stink-name = have a foul odor
devil-damnation-space-immunity-name = gain immunity to space
devil-damnation-all-seeing-name = gain knowledge of my surroundings
devil-damnation-magic-name = gain arcane powers
devil-damnation-health-name = gain self rejuvenation
devil-damnation-power-name = gain power over others
devil-damnation-gun-name = receive a great equalizer
