devil-damnation-soul-desc = The signator forfeits their soul to you. Upon death, their soul will be sent to the depths of hell, rendering their corpse unrevivable.
devil-damnation-pacifism-desc = The signator gives up their inner fight, becoming unable to bring harm to anything living or inanimate.
devil-damnation-blindness-desc = The signator forfeits their ability to see.
devil-damnation-time-desc = The signator forfeits their life, leaving them with five minutes left to live.
devil-damnation-credits-desc = The signator forfeits 5000 credits.
devil-damnation-purpose-desc = The signator received a fate worse than death.
devil-damnation-humanity-desc = The signator will regress into a more primitive form.
devil-damnation-organ-desc = The signator loses a random organ. This could be anything from their lungs to a kidney.
devil-damnation-terminator-desc = The future is imperceptibly modified, putting the signator square in the sights of a vengeful actor.
devil-damnation-mute-desc = Makes the signator mute
devil-damnation-stink-desc = The signator constantly leeches ammonia.
devil-damnation-space-immunity-desc = The signator becomes immune to space, no longer bound by their fear.
devil-damnation-all-seeing-desc = the signator can perceive through walls.
devil-damnation-magic-desc = The signator learns some magical transport spells.
devil-damnation-health-desc = The signator gains the ability to totally restore their health, once.
devil-damnation-power-desc = The signator gains a piece of armor and a blade, so that they can rend their will upon the world.
devil-damnation-gun-desc = The signator receives a gun. We bought some arms futures and it didn't exactly turn out, need to get this crap off our hands.
devil-damnation-electricity-desc = The signator becomes.... insulated
devil-damnation-noslip-desc = The signator cannot slip anymore
devil-damnation-test-fail-desc = The contract will never be able to complete
